---
interface Props { booking?: boolean; }
const { booking = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="consultation-outcomes">
  <div class="consultation-outcomes__inner">
    <header>
      <p class="consultation-outcomes__eyebrow">Your First Step</p>
      <h2>30分で、次に確認することを整理します。</h2>
      <p>営業・マーケティングの責任者、システム運用担当の方へ。HubSpot・Salesforceの利用中・併用中はもちろん、導入前のご相談も受け付けています。</p>
    </header>
    <p class="consultation-outcomes__example">たとえば「営業に渡した見込み客が、追われていない」場合。</p>
    <div class="consultation-outcomes__grid">
      <article>
        <h3><span>01</span>どこで止まっているか</h3>
        <figure class="consultation-example">
          <div class="handoff" role="img" aria-label="マーケティングから営業に引き継いでも、担当と対応期限が不明だと商談まで進まない例">
            <div class="handoff__nodes"><span>マーケ</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b><span>営業</span><i aria-hidden="true">···</i><span class="handoff__pending">商談</span></div>
            <div class="handoff__gap"><span>担当は？　対応期限は？</span></div>
          </div>
          <figcaption>引き継ぎから商談までをたどり、止まっている箇所を絞ります。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3><span>02</span>先に何を直すか</h3>
        <figure class="consultation-example">
          <ol class="priorities" aria-label="設定を変更する前に確認する順序の例">
            <li><span class="priorities__first">先に</span><span>担当と期限を決める</span></li>
            <li class="priorities__connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</li>
            <li><span>次に</span><span>割り当て・通知の設定</span></li>
          </ol>
          <figcaption>この場合は、運用ルールを決めてからシステム設定を見直します。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3><span>03</span>誰が、どう進めるか</h3>
        <figure class="consultation-example">
          <dl class="responsibilities" aria-label="次に進めることの分担例">
            <div><dt>社内で確認</dt><dd>担当者・対応期限</dd></div>
            <div><dt>支援を検討</dt><dd>割り当て・通知の設定</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <figcaption>社内で進めることと、調査・実装の支援が要ることを分けます。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="consultation-outcomes__preparation">お話しいただくのは、使っているシステム名と、最近困った場面を一つ。資料・管理者権限は不要です。</p>
    <p class="consultation-outcomes__scope">30分では状況を整理します。詳細な環境調査・データ分析・設計書の作成は別途ご相談となります。</p>
    <div class="consultation-outcomes__actions">
      <a class="consultation-outcomes__button" href={booking ? '#booking' : '/free-consultation/#booking'}>30分の無料相談を予約する →</a>
      <a href="/case-studies/hubspot-sales-handoff-lead-to-revenue/">HubSpotで営業への引き継ぎを整えた支援事例を見る →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.consultation-outcomes { background: #F1F5F9; padding: 4rem 0; color: var(--color-text); }
.consultation-outcomes__inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
.consultation-outcomes header { max-width: 800px; }
.consultation-outcomes__eyebrow { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-navy); margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
.consultation-outcomes h2 { color: var(--color-navy); font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.consultation-outcomes p, .consultation-example figcaption { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.consultation-outcomes .consultation-outcomes__example { margin: 1.75rem 0 1rem; color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }
.consultation-outcomes__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
.consultation-outcomes article { background: white; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.25rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgb(15 23 42 / .04); }
.consultation-outcomes h3 { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .625rem; color: var(--color-navy); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
.consultation-outcomes h3 > span { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
.consultation-example { margin: 0; }
.consultation-example figcaption { margin-top: 1rem; }
/* The shaded panel contains the diagram; its caption stays outside. */
.consultation-example > :not(figcaption) { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 156px; padding: 1rem; background: #F1F5F9; border: 1px solid #CBD5E1; border-radius: 6px; }

.handoff, .priorities, .responsibilities { min-height: 122px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #0F172A; }
.handoff { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.handoff__nodes { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: .25rem; }
.handoff__nodes > span { padding: .5rem .375rem; border: 1px solid #0F172A; border-radius: 4px; background: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }
.handoff__nodes b { font-weight: 400; }
.handoff__nodes i { color: #2563EB; font-size: 22px; font-style: normal; }
.handoff__nodes > .handoff__pending { background: #fff; border-style: dashed; color: #475569; }
.handoff__gap { margin: 1rem 0 0; padding-top: .5rem; border-top: 1px dashed #2563EB; text-align: center; color: #2563EB; }
.priorities { padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.priorities li:not(.priorities__connector) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }
.priorities li > span:first-child { font-size: 14px; text-align: center; }
.priorities__first { border: 1px solid #2563EB; border-radius: 4px; color: #2563EB; padding: .25rem 0; }
.priorities li > span:last-child { padding: .5rem; border: 1px solid #0F172A; border-radius: 4px; background: #fff; }
.priorities__connector { padding-left: 52px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; }
.responsibilities { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: .75rem; margin: 0; }
.responsibilities > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .125rem; padding-left: .75rem; border-left: 1px solid #0F172A; }
.responsibilities dt { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; }
.responsibilities dd { margin: 0; }
.consultation-outcomes__preparation, .consultation-outcomes__scope { max-width: 900px; }
.consultation-outcomes__preparation { margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
.consultation-outcomes__actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.25rem 2rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
.consultation-outcomes__actions a { color: #7042ac; font-size: 16px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.consultation-outcomes__actions .consultation-outcomes__button { display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; background: #8758C9; color: white; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
.consultation-outcomes__button:hover { background: #7042ac; }
@media(max-width: 900px) { .consultation-outcomes__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .handoff, .priorities, .responsibilities { min-height: 0; } .consultation-example { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 1fr) 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; } .consultation-example figcaption { margin-top: 0; } }
@media(max-width: 600px) { .consultation-outcomes__inner { padding: 0 1.25rem; } .consultation-example { display: block; } .consultation-example figcaption { margin-top: 1rem; }
/* The shaded panel contains the diagram; its caption stays outside. */
.consultation-example > :not(figcaption) { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 156px; padding: 1rem; background: #F1F5F9; border: 1px solid #CBD5E1; border-radius: 6px; }
 .consultation-outcomes__actions { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
